{"id":841808,"title":"08｜Codebase","content":"Code base是用于索引项目代码的工具，帮助更深入理解项目结构和文件关联。通过配置可控制索引生成与更新，支持忽略特定文件或文件夹以节省时间和资源。新文件夹默认被索引，但可通过设置调整。忽略功能对不需要索引的大文件如图片、第三方依赖库等特别有用，有助于保护敏感信息不被上传至云端。此外，还可选择同步Git历史记录，便于追踪版本变更。Code base能辅助分析项目用途和技术栈，根据功能描述定位相关文件，并查找函数及其调用位置。演示了如何利用Code base快速掌握新项目的技术细节和功能实现，提高开发效率。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":397349,"user_name":"凌志","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1354586,"ip_address":"海南","ucode":"477C4C1E9839DE","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/14/ab/5a/c8d37966.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1737771646,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144182,"content":"agent模式下不支持@codebase，但是它会自己根据情况去检索代码文件","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1737895221,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":397349,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"为什么在某些项目里，我输入@符号，找不到CodeBase，什么原因？如何解决","like_count":3,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":656548,"discussion_content":"agent模式下不支持@codebase，但是它会自己根据情况去检索代码文件","content_length":38,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1737895221,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":397724,"user_name":"Candy","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2838048,"ip_address":"安徽","ucode":"00AFA677FB839F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/2b/4e/20/60292ebe.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1739429560,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144314,"content":"在有需要的时候codebase即可，第一次@是为了让上下文知道都有哪些代码文件。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1739457691,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":397724,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"@codebase 只需要声明执行一次，后续对话就默认会包含codebase的上下文信息了吗？看课程视频中的演示，似乎是仅仅@codebase了一次，后续的多轮对话都没有任何的引用上下文申明，都是直接提出问题的","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":657175,"discussion_content":"在有需要的时候codebase即可，第一次@是为了让上下文知道都有哪些代码文件。","content_length":40,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1739457691,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":397370,"user_name":"天亮了","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1402260,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"F5CEFC4B8F06EA","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/15/65/94/829f321f.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1738047799,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144197,"content":"个人觉得不用太纠结这个，就像我们养成经常ctrl s保存文件的习惯一样，在需要codebase处理前所重新索引一下没有啥坏处哈","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1738295217,"ip_address":"河北","comment_id":397370,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100855101,"comment_content":"在既有项目，用 composer 生成新的多个文件，似乎不需要像视频中一样重建索引。虽然 @Codebase 可以看到 search 的列表没有新文件，但问这个项目有哪些文件的时候，依然能解答。不知道是不是 0.44 版本升级的原因","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https: